          "python",
          "\u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510\n\u2502              Developer Portal (Backstage)         \u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2524\n\u2502  Service Catalog \u2502 Templates \u2502 Docs \u2502 Scorecards \u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2524\n\u2502         Self-Service Infrastructure              \u2502\n\u2502  \u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510 \u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510 \u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510     \u2502\n\u2502  \u2502 Databases \u2502 \u2502 K8s Deploy \u2502 \u2502 Pipelines \u2502     \u2502\n\u2502  \u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518 \u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518 \u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518     \u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2524\n\u2502         Terraform / Crossplane / Pulumi          \u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2524\n\u2502         AWS / Azure / GCP                        \u2502\n\u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "yaml",
          "# backstage/catalog-info.yaml - Register a service\napiVersion: backstage.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Component\nmetadata:\n  name: payment-service\n  description: Handles payment processing\n  annotations:\n    github.com/project-slug: myorg/payment-service\n    pagerduty.com/service-id: P123ABC\n  tags:\n    - python\n    - grpc\nspec:\n  type: service\n  lifecycle: production\n  owner: team-payments\n  dependsOn:\n    - component:user-service\n    - resource:postgres-payments\n  providesApis:\n    - payment-api"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "yaml",
          "# scaffolder-template.yaml - \"Create a new microservice\"\napiVersion: scaffolder.backstage.io/v1beta3\nkind: Template\nmetadata:\n  name: new-microservice\n  title: Create Microservice\n  description: Spin up a production-ready microservice in 5 minutes\nspec:\n  parameters:\n    - title: Service Info\n      properties:\n        name:\n          title: Service Name\n          type: string\n        team:\n          title: Owning Team\n          type: string\n          enum: [platform, payments, auth, data]\n        language:\n          title: Language\n          type: string\n          enum: [python, go, typescript]\n  steps:\n    - id: scaffold\n      name: Generate code\n      action: fetch:template\n      input:\n        url: ./skeleton/${{ parameters.language }}\n        values:\n          name: ${{ parameters.name }}\n          team: ${{ parameters.team }}\n    - id: create-repo\n      name: Create GitHub repo\n      action: publish:github\n      input:\n        repoUrl: github.com?owner=myorg&repo=${{ parameters.name }}\n    - id: create-infra\n      name: Provision infrastructure\n      action: terraform:apply\n      input:\n        workspace: ${{ parameters.name }}"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "yaml",
          "# Developers request infrastructure using familiar K8s YAML\napiVersion: database.example.com/v1alpha1\nkind: PostgreSQLInstance\nmetadata:\n  name: my-db\n  namespace: team-alpha\nspec:\n  parameters:\n    storageGB: 50\n    version: \"16\"\n    highAvailability: true\n  compositionSelector:\n    matchLabels:\n      provider: aws\n      environment: production\n  writeConnectionSecretToRef:\n    name: db-connection\n# Platform team defines what this ACTUALLY provisions (RDS, security groups, etc.)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "yaml",
          "# Track if services meet production standards\nscorecards:\n  payment-service:\n    checks:\n      - name: Has CI/CD pipeline\n        status: passing\n      - name: Has health check endpoint\n        status: passing\n      - name: Has runbook documentation\n        status: failing  # needs attention\n      - name: Has alerts configured\n        status: passing\n      - name: Has load test results\n        status: failing\n      - name: Follows naming conventions\n        status: passing\n    score: 4/6 (67%)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "What platform teams build:\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Self-service infrastructure provisioning\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Standardized CI/CD templates\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Service mesh and networking\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Observability stack (metrics, logs, traces)\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Security baselines and policies\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Developer documentation and golden paths\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Cost visibility and optimization\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 On-call tooling and incident management\n\nWhat they DON'T do:\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Write application code for product teams\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Deploy individual services manually\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 Make architectural decisions for teams"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "# Key metrics for an IDP\nmetrics = {\n    \"deployment_frequency\": \"How often teams deploy (target: daily)\",\n    \"lead_time\": \"Code commit to production (target: < 1 hour)\",\n    \"change_failure_rate\": \"% deployments causing issues (target: < 5%)\",\n    \"mttr\": \"Mean time to recovery (target: < 30 min)\",\n    \"developer_satisfaction\": \"NPS from internal surveys (target: > 50)\",\n    \"time_to_first_deploy\": \"New service \u2192 first production deploy (target: < 1 day)\",\n    \"cognitive_load\": \"Survey: ease of deploying/operating (target: improving)\",\n}"
        ]
      ]
    }
